  ('C', 'P6-E11', 'If the entity has operations/offices in/around ecologically sensitive areas (such as national parks, wildlife sanctuaries, biosphere reserves, wetlands, biodiversity hotspots, forests, coastal regulation zones etc.) where environmental approvals / clearances are required, please specify details.', 'essential', 6, null, 6011, '{15}', 'Principle 6, Essential Indicator 11.'),
