  ('C', 'P6-L4', 'If the entity has undertaken any specific initiatives or used innovative technology or solutions to improve resource efficiency, or reduce impact due to emissions / effluent discharge / waste generated, please provide details of the same as well as outcome of such initiatives.', 'leadership', 6, null, 6504, '{}', 'Principle 6, Leadership Indicator 4.'),
