  ('C', 'P7-E1', 'a. Number of affiliations with trade and industry chambers/ associations. b. List the top 10 trade and industry chambers/ associations (determined based on the total members of such body) the entity is a member of/ affiliated to.', 'essential', 7, null, 7001, '{17}', 'Principle 7, Essential Indicator 1.'),
