  ('C', 'P9-L4', 'Does the entity display product information on the product over and above what is mandated as per local laws? (Yes/No/Not Applicable) If yes, provide details in brief. Did your entity carry out any survey with regard to consumer satisfaction relating to the major products / services of the entity, significant locations of operation of the entity or the entity as a whole? (Yes/No)', 'leadership', 9, null, 9504, '{}', 'Principle 9, Leadership Indicator 4.')
